summary: The metarecord-list panel type

!! Commands

* ``metarecord-list:apply`` — Metarecord list: apply a zone's content
* ``metarecord-list:clear`` — Metarecord list: clear a zone
* ``metarecord-list:first`` — Metarecord list: move the selection to the first row
* ``metarecord-list:focus`` — Metarecord list: focus a zone
* ``metarecord-list:insert`` — Metarecord list: insert text into a zone
* ``metarecord-list:last`` — Metarecord list: move the selection to the last loaded row
* ``metarecord-list:next`` — Metarecord list: move the selection down
* ``metarecord-list:open`` — Metarecord list: open the selection in the other panel
* ``metarecord-list:open-bulk-edit`` — Metarecord list: open the bulk edit / delete form (set/add/remove/unset/delete)
* ``metarecord-list:page`` — Metarecord list: load a page (next)
* ``metarecord-list:prev`` — Metarecord list: move the selection up
* ``metarecord-list:query`` — Metarecord list: run a canned query (duplicates / orphans)
* ``metarecord-list:refresh`` — Metarecord list: reload from the daemon
* ``metarecord-list:select`` — Metarecord list: change the multi-selection (toggle / all / none)
* ``metarecord-list:set`` — Metarecord list: change a view setting
* ``metarecord-list:toggle`` — Metarecord list: toggle a view flag
